\title{affirmoTM: Disease-State Transition Model for the AFFIRMO iABC Pathway Cost-Effectiveness Analysis}
\description{
An annual-cycle disease-state transition model for adults aged 65 and over with atrial fibrillation and multimorbidity, ported as a standalone package from the transition model of the IMPACTaf model. It compares the AFFIRMO integrated ABC (iABC) pathway with usual care using user-supplied transition probabilities, costs and utilities, and reports incremental cost-effectiveness ratios and the cost-effectiveness plane.
